Render the user's local Blender scene (Workbench shading with textures and material colors) and return the image, to check shape, proportions, and textures. Renders `collection` or `objects`, else every visible mesh. Several views are tiled into one image, with the rows listed in the reply. Costs 0.5 Ropilot Actions.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__ropilot__ropilot_blender_screenshot(args: {
  // Only render this collection
  collection?: string;
  // Only render these objects
  objects?: Array<string>;
  // Pixels per view (128-1024, default 768 for one view and 512 for several)
  size?: number;
  // Camera views (default ["iso"], up to 6). Front is Blender -Y, which faces +Z in Roblox.
  views?: Array<"iso" | "front" | "back" | "left" | "right" | "top" | "bottom">;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

